	(text "ECDSA-signed events + GPS -> Solidity quality-score contract\nScore = 100 - sigma(T_act - T_set)*t - penalty\nPayout: > 90 : 100 %  |  70-90 : 80 %\n<= 70 : 50 %  |  tamper flag -> review"
