	(text "PCM packs hold 4 +/- 2 degC for >= 8 h\nTEC fires only if T_int >= 5 degC\nPELTIER_REQ -> ESP32 PWM + dual enable\nHot-side NTC and fan tach feed ESP32 inputs;\nfirmware drops TEC_EN/PWM on over-temp or tach fault."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
